# Copy to `.env.local` and set VITE_API_BASE_URL to your backend's API prefix
# (e.g. http://localhost:8787/api) to swap in the REST client; leave empty for local-first.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
# Optional experimental advice seam (SPEC-JEV-ADVICE). Pick ONE live transport:
#   VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY — live Jev via OpenRouter (typesafe/jev-1.13); keep in
#     .env.local only (gitignored) — VITE_ vars are bundled into the client.
#   VITE_ADVICE_URL — raw custom endpoint (POST, see README). Wins over OpenRouter.
# VITE_ADVICE_MODEL — optional OpenRouter model override (default typesafe/jev-1.13).
# VITE_ADVICE_MOCK=1 — deterministic mock for UI tests (wins over both live transports).
# ALL unset = feature completely invisible.
VITE_OPENROUTER_API_KEY=
VITE_ADVICE_MODEL=
VITE_ADVICE_URL=
VITE_ADVICE_MOCK=
